{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"智利","country_iso":"CHL","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:33:21.670009","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"CHL-ES-0009","ldc":"No","location":"北部科皮亚波市附近","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"智利Atacama 113MW储能项目","project_name_en":"Chile Atacama 113MW Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中电国际","content":"智利时间2023年12月21日，中电国际所属太平洋水电智利公司签发Atacama储能项目开工令，标志着该项目正式进入建设阶段。\nAtacama储能项目位于智利北部科皮亚波市附近中电国际投资的Atacama及Solar 9在建光伏项目升压站内，装机容量113MW/243MWh，计划于2024年底与光伏项目一同并网投产。山东电力工程咨询院有限公司、新源智储能源发展（北京）有限公司凭借自身市场竞争力，在众多供应商中脱颖而出，成为本项目的EPC承包商和储能系统供应商。本项目建成投产后有望成为中国企业海外自主投资开发的规模最大的商业储能项目，位列南美装机容量最大的电化学储能项目之一。\nAtacama储能项目的投资建设是中电国际落实国家电投“2035一流战略”，践行ESG理念，深耕重点国别市场，把握智利市场峰谷电价差增大趋势、抢抓智利政府鼓励长时储能政策窗口期的重要举措。中电国际将继续深耕智利市场，助力智利实现2050年碳中和目标。","content_sha256":"6312a2ac22c790487f49181a7097d47c19e73e013f3d87b269c51464b9fbb0a9","id":10356,"publish_date":"2023-12-24 18:13:02","title":"智利最大中资储能项目开工","title_sha256":"02a5472e2e871ece30bb7342668805858697dbaf6e458f3f48ac5a8e6d8af88f","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/56561.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"CHL-ES-0009","capacity_details":"BESS: 113MW/243MWh","capacity_mw":113.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"113","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:33:21.670707","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"CHL-ES-0009-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.energytrend.cn/news/20231227-132202.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"2024-12-01","planned_start_date":"2023-12-21","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"中电国际所属太平洋水电智利公司","project_devel